From: qzshch <qzshch@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 21:47:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/14] feat(ops): span_accumulate working-set capture
 primitive

Accumulates a column span of a feature-first BF16 [rows, tokens] tensor
into an FP32 [rows] sum (+=, so per-chunk calls compose across a turn).
This is the capture primitive for sparse working-set retrieval: the
attention path will call it over the pre-RoPE query (chunk-local span)
and over the key columns of each 128-token retrieval block that fills,
feeding the host RetrievalIndex at turn boundaries.

